         height="200";>
        
         <p class="discribe4">The cuisine of south India is known for its light, low calorie appetizing dishes. The traditional food of south India is mainly rice based. The cuisine is famous for wonderful mixing of rice nad lentils to prepare yummy lip smacking dosas, vadas, idilis and uttapams</p>
